  "abstract": "Ablate horizon ramp: increase terminal gamma slightly from 0.99 to 0.992 on ScalarRamp LN-RFFT (p=36, H=128, drop=0.05, Clip=1.0) at lr=9e-4 to test late-horizon balance.",
